contentText:
G Flip and Chrishell Stause have broken up after more than four years together, the couple announced Monday (Oct. 26).

The singer and Selling Sunset star both posted their own statements addressing the news, with G writing on Instagram, &#8220;Chrishell and I are no longer together.&#8221;

